          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Zustimmung — \"the approval, the consent\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Für den Ausflug brauchen die Kinder die Zustimmung der Eltern. For the trip the children need their parents' consent."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Zustimmung finden — to meet with approval."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Zustimmung is the noun of zustimmen, formed with -ung; the verb is made from Stimme \"voice, vote\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
